# Docker preview stack (docker-compose.preview.yml): the locally-trusted CA
# certificate a developer extracts from Caddy's persisted volume to install
# on a test phone, per README.md's "PWA and offline" quick start and
# docs/device-smoke-tests.md. Not a secret (it never leaves the local
# machine/phone pair), but it's a generated artifact, not source.
gym-hud-preview-ca.crt
